(text "5 V input: 4.75-5.25 V at the module contacts.\nAll six 5 V contacts and every ground contact are connected.\nGPIO_VREF uses CM4_3V3; never feed an external 3.3 V rail here.\nCM4_3V3 and CM4_1V8: 600 mA total per rail.\nBoth rails turn off when GLOBAL_EN is held low.\nCarrier load budget / input current limit: integration pending.\nModule load-current table gives typical, not maximum, values." (at 17.78 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5f186935-8d6a-5ece-b478-a8640fef6fe6"))
