(text "Open switches use the CM4 internal pull-ups.\nRESET discharges RUN_PG through the specified 220R resistor.\nHold RECOVERY at startup for rpiboot; hold WP to inhibit writes.\nGLOBAL_EN low >1 ms restarts CM4 after software shutdown.\nDo not use WAKE / OFF before the OS has shut down.\nReserved contact 76 and unused PMIC analog pins remain isolated." (at 220.98 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a9905d73-5929-5f63-a322-60916ad52dd2"))
)
